{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Drift Overdrive</strong> is a single-player arcade racing game where every turn is a challenge and every lap is a chance to push yourself further. Inspired by the retro-futuristic style of the 80s, you\u2019ll glide through vibrant neon tracks, chase the perfect lap, and put your reflexes to the test with out-of-this-world drifts.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058900/extras/dea252921ea44141bd53665a57d647ac.avif?t=1759448117\" width=920 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">With mechanics that are simple to learn but hard to master, <strong>Drift Overdrive</strong> turns every lap into a unique and rewarding experience. Avoid crashes or falls, collect everything along the way, and prove that you can become the true <u><strong>Drift King (or Drift Queen)</strong></u>.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058900/extras/042206deb4e8b7b1a254e70afed8070c.poster.avif?t=1759448117\" width=720 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058900/extras/042206deb4e8b7b1a254e70afed8070c.webm?t=1759448117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058900/extras/042206deb4e8b7b1a254e70afed8070c.mp4?t=1759448117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Get ready for a unique blend of low-poly and synthwave aesthetics, along with an immersive soundtrack that will transport you to another world.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058900/extras/2f506c0a6cd72149842ce9dc4819fdcc.poster.avif?t=1759448117\" width=720 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058900/extras/2f506c0a6cd72149842ce9dc4819fdcc.webm?t=1759448117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058900/extras/2f506c0a6cd72149842ce9dc4819fdcc.mp4?t=1759448117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4058900?t=1759448117","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058900/04ac403d1f0132cb2c6bc5603a9dbd3a9db328b0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759448117","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058900/f0d3861f128ef6321bb34e2cdc97a2872489a269/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759448117","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058900/f0d3861f128ef6321bb34e2cdc97a2872489a269/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759448117","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Drift Overdrive</strong> is a single-player arcade racing game where every turn is a challenge and every lap is a chance to push yourself further. Inspired by the retro-futuristic style of the 80s, you\u2019ll glide through vibrant neon tracks, chase the perfect lap, and put your reflexes to the test with out-of-this-world drifts.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058900/extras/dea252921ea44141bd53665a57d647ac.avif?t=1759448117\" width=920 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">With mechanics that are simple to learn but hard to master, <strong>Drift Overdrive</strong> turns every lap into a unique and rewarding experience. Avoid crashes or falls, collect everything along the way, and prove that you can become the true <u><strong>Drift King (or Drift Queen)</strong></u>.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058900/extras/042206deb4e8b7b1a254e70afed8070c.poster.avif?t=1759448117\" width=720 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058900/extras/042206deb4e8b7b1a254e70afed8070c.webm?t=1759448117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058900/extras/042206deb4e8b7b1a254e70afed8070c.mp4?t=1759448117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Get ready for a unique blend of low-poly and synthwave aesthetics, along with an immersive soundtrack that will transport you to another world.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058900/extras/2f506c0a6cd72149842ce9dc4819fdcc.poster.avif?t=1759448117\" width=720 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058900/extras/2f506c0a6cd72149842ce9dc4819fdcc.webm?t=1759448117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058900/extras/2f506c0a6cd72149842ce9dc4819fdcc.mp4?t=1759448117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Neon Apex Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058900/6d90368702a23a03e69035e360051